        "title": "Setting Up the Quadratic",
        "text": "Substitute: -45 = 15t + ½(-10)t² which gives -45 = 15t - 5t². Rearrange to standard form: 5t² - 15t - 45 = 0, or t² - 3t - 9 = 0.",
